            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha ca 109",
            "review_text": "hk-san\nTokyo Prefecture, Japan609 contributions\n0\nTastes good ...\nSep 2025 • Solo\nI think it tastes good. I don't think it's that good because I'm not such a fan of Bunchaka, but I think people who like Satsumaage like it.\nIt tastes good, but I had a bad aftertaste from the experience that I pointed out to an old lady who came to order it and begged her to put it on number 6, but she told me to put it on number 5 (all served) in Vietnamese, and I said no, number 6 several times, but she didn't listen, forcing me to put all the 5s on. It was 10,000 VND higher. The man's clerk was normal. I don't know if she's licking tourists or if she's been nice enough to (force) them to serve everything, but I don't feel good.\nI probably won't go there again unless someone tells me I want to.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten September 6, 2025",
